### Smoke tests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:3333/api

### Login
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@sic.dev", "password": "admin123" }

### Guardar token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar solicitação
# @name novaSC
POST {{base}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "costCenterId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "categoryId": "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "title": "Cadeiras ergonômicas",
  "justification": "Reposição de mobiliário",
  "priority": "normal",
  "items": [
    { "description": "Cadeira ergonômica", "unit": "un", "quantity": 10, "estimatedPrice": 900 }
  ]
}

### Submeter para aprovação
POST {{base}}/requests/{{novaSC.response.body.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inbox de aprovações (logar como gestor@sic.dev p/ faixa 5k-50k)
GET {{base}}/approvals/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Decisão
POST {{base}}/approvals/{{novaSC.response.body.id}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "aprovado", "comment": "OK" }

### Situação orçamentária
GET {{base}}/budget?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Relatório CSV
GET {{base}}/reports/compras-por-fornecedor?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trilha de auditoria
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?entity=purchase_requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
